                Ben Dinh vs. Ben Duoc: The Definitive Sector Choice
              </h2>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-[16px]">
              When booking a trip from Saigon, many travelers don't realize there are two separate visitor sites operated by the relic management board: <strong>Ben Dinh</strong> and <strong>Ben Duoc</strong>. Choosing between them is the single biggest factor shaping your visit:
            </p>

