                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Documentary & Relief Map Briefing</div>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">You start in an open-air thatched pavilion, watching black-and-white archival film from the 1960s and studying three-dimensional relief models of the multi-tiered defense system.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Forest Walk & Camouflage Displays</div>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Your guide leads you along dirt trails beneath rubber and mahogany trees, pointing out bomb craters, defoliation scars, and leaf-covered entrance shafts.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Trapdoor Entry Demonstration</div>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">On-site guides demonstrate sliding feet-first into micro-shafts. Anyone comfortable can step inside the trapdoor for a classic photo.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Defensive Trap Gallery</div>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Reconstructed punji stick traps, swinging spike arms, rolling traps, and folding-door traps crafted from sharpened bamboo and salvaged metal.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">5</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Wartime Artifacts & Tanks</div>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Walk past an authentic American M41 Walker Bulldog tank disabled by a guerrilla mine in 1970, unexploded bomb casings, and a workshop showing how fighters forged tire sandals (<em>dép lốp</em>) from aircraft tires.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">6</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">The Optional Tunnel Crawl</div>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-0.5">An opportunity to experience the subterranean passages firsthand. Exits are spaced every 15 to 20 meters so you can climb out whenever you wish.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">7</span>
