          <section id="how-long-do-you-need" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-4">
            <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4 mb-4">
              <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-[26px] font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
                How Long Do You Need For A Cu Chi Visit?
              </h2>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-[16px]">
              Door-to-door trip duration depends primarily on your itinerary format:
            </p>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4">
              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2">
                <div class="text-amber-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Half-Day Itinerary (Recommended for 80% of Travelers)</div>
                <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">5 to 6 Hours Door-to-Door</div>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                  Spend 2 to 2.5 hours on-site. Depart Saigon at 07:30 AM, arrive by 09:15 AM, explore until 11:45 AM, and return to downtown District 1 by 01:15 PM. Gets you through the circuit before midday heat peaks, leaving your afternoon free to explore central District 1 via the <a href="/saigon-hop-on-hop-off-bus-guide" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">Saigon hop-on hop-off bus</a>, browse cafes, or relax.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2">
                <div class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Full-Day Combination Itinerary</div>
                <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">8 to 10 Hours Door-to-Door</div>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                  Spend 2.5 to 3.5 hours at Cu Chi, paired with downtown war heritage sites (War Remnants Museum, <a href="/independence-palace-saigon-guide" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">Independence Palace</a>) or the Cao Dai Temple in Tay Ninh. <strong>Note on Mekong Delta combos:</strong> Heavily advertised by budget operators, but requires 7+ hours stuck in traffic covering 200+ km. We strongly recommend dedicating a separate day to explore the <a href="/destination/mekong-delta" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">Mekong Delta</a> waterways.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">
              For a detailed timing comparison, see our guide: <a href="/cu-chi-tunnels-half-day-vs-full-day" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">Cu Chi Tunnels Half-Day vs. Full-Day: Which Tour Should You Choose?</a>
            </p>

